{"product_id":"somme-stations","title":"Somme Stations","description":"Paperback. Pub Date :2012-02-01 304 English Faber \u0026amp; Faber On the first day of the Somme enlisted railwayman Jim Stringer lies trapped in a shell hole. smoking cigarette after cigarette under the bullets and the blazing sun . He calculates his chances of survival - even before they departed for France. a member of Jims unit had been found dead.During the stand-off that follows. Jim and his comrades must operate by night the vitally important trains carrying munitions to the Front . through a ghostly landscape of shattered trees where high explosive and shrapnel shells rain down. Close co-operation and trust are vital. Yet proof piles up of an enemy within. and as a ferocious military policeman pursues his investigation into the original killing. the finger of accusation begins to point towards Jim himself.\nDimensions: 127 x 198\nAuthor: Andrew Martin\nISBN: 9780571249640\nFormat: Paperback\nPages: 304","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45696238256281,"sku":"15RA-39780571249640","price":20.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68b911d2dcc04_Somme_Stations_Andrew_Martin.jpg?v=1756998609","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/somme-stations","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}